    "text": "I didn't listen, but if this is the same kind of speech that liberal twits use that has the synonym of taxing you, then I'm already against it. Now, if on the other hand, if it's coming via tariffs, I don't care. I'm sick of paying taxes. I should own my home, not paying a damn property tax to keep it from being ripped out from under me. I should be able to buy a lifetime license plate, one time for some kind of reasonable fee, not thousands of dollars, either and transferrable to any vehicle I own; maybe eventually I trade the vehicle I own and get another one. I should be able to take my plates to anything I drive that I also own. I wonder how many thousands of dollars I've paid in taxes over my 95 years. Who knows.",
